Third-party code
----------------

source/discovery/ is a Go port of anitorrent
(https://github.com/anh9000/anitorrent), the Hayase torrent-source extension
pack, licensed under GPL-3.0. Ported: src/lib/shared.js (title tokens,
episode/season/batch matching, AniList prequel-chain episode offsets, result
ranking), src/lib/aliases.js, and the AnimeTosho, SeaDex, SubsPlease, Nyaa,
Yameii and ToonsHub sources. AnimeTosho lookups also use anitorrent's
data/anilist-to-anidb.json mapping, fetched at runtime.
